<title>USA: USDA accepts DEIP bid to Africa, Middle East.</title>
<headline>USDA accepts DEIP bid to Africa, Middle East.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Monday said it accepted a bid from America Midwest Commodities Export Co Inc to sell 21 tonnes of mozzarella cheese to Africa and the Mideast.</p>
<p>USDA said the bonus was $645 per tonne and delivery was set for Jan. 27 - Feb. 28.</p>
<p>The remaining DEIP balance is 1,974 tonnes.</p>
